# MockMentor — environment variables

# ── LOCAL DEV (Vite) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# When running `npm run dev` + `npx vercel dev` together, the serverless
# function reads OPENROUTER_API_KEY from this file automatically (vercel dev loads .env).
# When running `npm run dev` alone (no function runner), /api/interview will 404.

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_api_key_here

# ── PRODUCTION (Vercel) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set OPENROUTER_API_KEY in the Vercel dashboard:
#   Project → Settings → Environment Variables → Add
#   Name: OPENROUTER_API_KEY   Value: <your key>   Environment: Production + Preview
#
# ⚠  Never commit your real key to the repository.
# ⚠  OPENROUTER_API_KEY is a server-side variable — it is never shipped to the browser.
